# YOUR TASK

Generate a hierarchical mind map of the key concepts in this module. The map should have:
- A central theme (the root node) representing the module's core topic
- 4–7 main branches representing major themes or concepts
- 2–4 sub-branches per main branch representing supporting details or sub-concepts

Keep labels short (3–6 words). Base every concept strictly on the provided content — never invent facts.

Return a JSON object with:
- `title`: a concise title for the mind map (the central theme, under 6 words)
- `root`: the root node object with `label` (string) and `children` (array of nodes)

Each node has:
- `label`: short concept label (3–6 words)
- `children`: array of child nodes (can be empty)
